{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879446",
      "title": "Why Is \"Just CSS\" Not Enough?",
      "lectureOrder": 196,
      "videoOrder": 171,
      "sourceHash": "a771eca291ae942ab8e9303688317efaf4226bd65acbaed95db5d34a94a08e09",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.59,
          "end": 5.63,
          "en": "So what would be a scenario where these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.63,
          "end": 10.13,
          "en": "basic CSS transitions and animations might not be enough?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.13,
          "end": 12.47,
          "en": "Well, first of all, and that's really important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.47,
          "end": 16.36,
          "en": "CSS animations and transitions will very often be enough,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.36,
          "end": 18.81,
          "en": "but adding them like we're currently doing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 22.09,
          "en": "that might not be enough, and here's an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.09,
          "end": 25.66,
          "en": "In our running application, if I take show dialog,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.66,
          "end": 28.57,
          "en": "this model dialog pops up immediately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.57,
          "end": 31.308,
          "en": "it's just there and it's gone when we close it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.308,
          "end": 32.98,
          "en": "This might be fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.98,
          "end": 35.909,
          "en": "This might be absolutely the behavior you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.909,
          "end": 39.76,
          "en": "but sometimes you might wanna animate it in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.76,
          "end": 41.26,
          "en": "You want to have a little animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.26,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "when it appears and the same for removing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 47.45,
          "en": "And that is the part that will be tricky",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.45,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "with just CSS animations and with just adding CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "with Vue as we did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "especially when you also want to animate the disappearance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 61.06,
          "en": "Let me show you why it's tricky.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.06,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "We can go to the base modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 65.47,
          "en": "which holds to code for this dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.47,
          "end": 68.86,
          "en": "and there on the dialog selector here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.86,
          "end": 71.08,
          "en": "we can add a little animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.08,
          "end": 74.75,
          "en": "We can for this again, to find some key frames here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.75,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "and give it any name of our choice and I'll name it modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 82.6,
          "en": "But again this name is up to you and I'll start at 0%",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.6,
          "end": 84.98,
          "en": "and I wanna go to 100%.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.98,
          "end": 88.57,
          "en": "And if you just define two styles, two states,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.57,
          "end": 89.74,
          "en": "as I'm doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.74,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "you can also use the from and to shorthands basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 98.39,
          "en": "And now here we define the starting state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.39,
          "end": 101.87,
          "en": "and there let's say the modal should initially be invisible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.87,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "by setting the opacity to zero with transform translate Y,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 111.543,
          "en": "I will move it up on the Y axis by 50 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.38,
          "end": 117.38,
          "en": "And I will actually also scale it from zero dot nine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.53,
          "end": 119.22999999999999,
          "en": "to its final size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.22999999999999,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "And speaking of final, in to, I now add the final states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 127.2,
          "en": "Opacity one, translate Y of zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.2,
          "end": 130.06,
          "en": "to reach the real position this element should have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.06,
          "end": 132.64,
          "en": "and scale one to reach the real size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.64,
          "end": 133.89,
          "en": "this element should have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.88,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "And now we could this modal animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 141.097,
          "en": "to our dialog selector to basically make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.097,
          "end": 144.41,
          "en": "that every dialog we're selecting with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.41,
          "end": 148.51,
          "en": "So the only dialog we have here receives that animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.51,
          "end": 149.48,
          "en": "And by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.48,
          "end": 151.79,
          "en": "the animation will be played when the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.79,
          "end": 154.42000000000002,
          "en": "is then first being part of the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.42000000000002,
          "end": 156.563,
          "en": "So the animation starts instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.66,
          "end": 161.582,
          "en": "We can utilize this here, with animation I can point at my",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.582,
          "end": 165.94,
          "en": "modal animation here, give it a duration, ease out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.85,
          "end": 170.74,
          "en": "and important, add forwards to tell CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.74,
          "end": 172.993,
          "en": "that the final state should be kept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.27,
          "end": 177.89,
          "en": "And if we now save everything, when I click show dialog,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.89,
          "end": 181.15,
          "en": "we have this little animation here, as you can tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.15,
          "end": 184.76,
          "en": "and we have this animation because the animation is part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.76,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "of the dialog selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 190.37,
          "en": "So whenever this selector finds something on the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.37,
          "end": 193.58,
          "en": "and it will find something when the dialogue is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.58,
          "end": 196.929,
          "en": "to the page, which I do in app Vue in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.929,
          "end": 200.92000000000002,
          "en": "with v-if on my custom component, the whole component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.92000000000002,
          "end": 203.88,
          "en": "is only added if dialog is visible as true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.88,
          "end": 206.59,
          "en": "and therefore the dialogue element in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.59,
          "end": 209.12,
          "en": "is only added under that circumstances.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.12,
          "end": 211.343,
          "en": "And therefore whenever that is the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.47,
          "end": 216.523,
          "en": "This here, this animation will be played thanks to that key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 221.56,
          "en": "but the problems start if we all do want to animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.56,
          "end": 223.8,
          "en": "the removal of the element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 227.1,
          "en": "if I wanna do that, currently it disappears instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.1,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "The problem we'll have is that the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 231.493,
          "en": "is detached from the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.38,
          "end": 236.46,
          "en": "And that means there is no way to animate it with CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.46,
          "end": 237.67000000000002,
          "en": "It's removed instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.67000000000002,
          "end": 241.62,
          "en": "You can't play an animation and then tell the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.62,
          "end": 244.525,
          "en": "to only remove it once that animation is finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 244.525,
          "end": 247.48,
          "en": "but that is what you would need to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.48,
          "end": 250.43,
          "en": "in order to animate the disappearance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.43,
          "end": 254.03,
          "en": "And that's exactly what Vue is able to help us with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.03,
          "end": 257.045,
          "en": "Vue can help us with animating the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.045,
          "end": 261.36,
          "en": "and also the disappearance of elements by for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.36,
          "end": 263.39,
          "en": "delaying the disappearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.39,
          "end": 265.803,
          "en": "until a certain animation has finished.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
